                                                "sense_id": "a4e147a4-86e4-37a0-888c-6d3c06dca1f6",
                                                "text": "Telly Savalas, Robert Culp and James Mason are the watchables in 1975's The Golden Heist […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "42385a69-5a4d-4a07-82b1-f75254bedaaa",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e147a4-86e4-37a0-888c-6d3c06dca1f6",
                                                "text": "Each January, San Diego Magazine announces its list of San Diegans worth watching — and watching out for — in the coming year with its \"People To Watch\" cover story. The magazine fetes its 50 watchables with a VIP bash […]"
